<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %> | Gerência de Eventos</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #0a0f1a; color: #e2e8f0; min-height: 100vh; }
    
    .topbar { background: rgba(15,23,42,0.8); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.1); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); padding: 0 2rem; height: 64px; display: flex; align-items: center; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
    .topbar-inner { width: 100%; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .logo { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: #e2e8f0; text-decoration: none; }
    .logo-icon { color: #60a5fa; }
    .topbar-nav { display: flex; gap: 0.25rem; align-items: center; }
    .topbar-nav a { color: #94a3b8; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; transition: all 0.15s; }
    .topbar-nav a:hover, .topbar-nav a.active { color: #e2e8f0; background: rgba(148,163,184,0.1); }
    .session-pill { padding: 0.42rem 0.78rem; border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.18); border-radius: 999px; color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.82rem; }
    .btn-logout { background: transparent; color: #f87171; border: 1px solid rgba(248,113,113,0.25); font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
    .btn-secondary { background: rgba(148,163,184,0.12); color: #e2e8f0; border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.18); text-decoration: none; }
    .btn-secondary { background: rgba(148,163,184,0.12); color: #e2e8f0; border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.18); text-decoration: none; }
    .btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(148,163,184,0.2); }

    .main-content { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem; }
    .page-header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .page-header h1 { font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #f1f5f9; }

    .stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .stats-group { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .stats-group-title { font-size: 0.82rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 0.85rem; }
    .stat-card { background: rgba(30,41,59,0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.1); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; }
    .stat-card .stat-label { font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .stat-card .stat-value { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #f1f5f9; }
    .stat-card.events .stat-value { color: #60a5fa; }
    .stat-card.articles .stat-value { color: #a78bfa; }
    .stat-card.pending-articles .stat-value { color: #fb7185; }
    .stat-card.review-running .stat-value { color: #fbbf24; }
    .stat-card.ready-decision .stat-value { color: #34d399; }
     .stat-card.reviewers .stat-value { color: #34d399; }
     .stat-card.inactive-reviewers .stat-value { color: #64748b; }
     .stat-card.pending-users .stat-value { color: #f59e0b; }
     .stat-card.published .stat-value { color: #fbbf24; }
     .stat-card.concluded .stat-value { color: #94a3b8; }
     .stat-card.total-users .stat-value { color: #60a5fa; }
     .stat-card.future-registrations .stat-value { color: #38bdf8; }

    .section { background: rgba(30,41,59,0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.1); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
    .section-header { padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.1); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .section-header h2 { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 600; color: #f1f5f9; }
    .section-body { padding: 0; }

    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    th { text-align: left; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #64748b; background: rgba(15,23,42,0.3); }
    td { padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #cbd5e1; border-top: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.05); }
    tr:hover td { background: rgba(148,163,184,0.03); }

    .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 9999px; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; }
    .badge-submitted { background: rgba(96,165,250,0.15); color: #60a5fa; }
    .badge-in-review { background: rgba(251,191,36,0.15); color: #fbbf24; }
    .badge-approved { background: rgba(52,211,153,0.15); color: #34d399; }
    .badge-rejected { background: rgba(248,113,113,0.15); color: #f87171; }
    .badge-oral { background: rgba(167,139,250,0.15); color: #a78bfa; }
    .badge-poster { background: rgba(56,189,248,0.15); color: #38bdf8; }

    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.375rem; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; border: none; transition: all 0.15s; }
    .btn-primary { background: #3b82f6; color: white; }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: #2563eb; }
    .btn-sm { padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem; font-size: 0.75rem; }
    .btn-ghost { background: transparent; color: #94a3b8; border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.2); }
    .btn-ghost:hover { background: rgba(148,163,184,0.1); color: #e2e8f0; }
    .btn-danger { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.15); color: #f87171; border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.2); }
    .btn-danger:hover { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.25); }
    .btn-success { background: rgba(52,211,153,0.15); color: #34d399; border: 1px solid rgba(52,211,153,0.2); text-decoration: none; }
    .btn-success:hover { background: rgba(52,211,153,0.25); }
    .btn-warn { background: rgba(251,191,36,0.15); color: #fbbf24; border: 1px solid rgba(251,191,36,0.2); text-decoration: none; }
    .btn-warn:hover { background: rgba(251,191,36,0.25); }

    .empty { padding: 3rem; text-align: center; color: #64748b; }
    .empty p { margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.875rem; }
    .table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
    .email-queue-summary { cursor: pointer; color: #93c5fd; font-size: .875rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.1); }
    .email-queue-summary:hover { background: rgba(59,130,246,.06); }
    .email-error { color: #fca5a5; display: block; margin-top: .25rem; max-width: 34rem; white-space: normal; }
    .email-status-queued { background: rgba(59,130,246,.15); color: #93c5fd; }
    .email-status-failed { background: rgba(239,68,68,.15); color: #fca5a5; }

    footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; color: #475569; font-size: 0.75rem; }
    a { color: #60a5fa; text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-inner">
      <a href="/" class="logo"><span class="logo-icon">◆</span> Gerência de Eventos</a>
      <nav class="topbar-nav">
        <a href="/admin" class="active">Dashboard</a>
        <a href="/admin/events" class="btn btn-secondary">Eventos</a>
        <a href="/admin/users" class="btn btn-secondary">Usuários</a>
        <% if (isReviewer) { %>
          <a href="/reviewer" class="btn btn-secondary">Painel do Revisor</a>
        <% } %>
        <% if (userEmail) { %><span class="session-pill"><%= userEmail %></span><% } %>
        <form method="POST" action="/admin/logout" style="display:inline">
          <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-logout">Sair</button>
        </form>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="main-content">
    <div class="page-header">
      <h1>Dashboard</h1>
      <% if (isReviewer) { %>
        <a href="/reviewer" class="btn btn-primary">Abrir Painel do Revisor</a>
      <% } %>
    </div>

    <div class="stats-group">
      <div class="stats-group-title">Eventos</div>
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card events">
          <div class="stat-label">Total de Eventos</div>
          <div class="stat-value"><%= totalEvents %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card published">
          <div class="stat-label">Eventos Publicados</div>
          <div class="stat-value"><%= publishedEvents %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card concluded">
          <div class="stat-label">Eventos Realizados</div>
          <div class="stat-value"><%= concludedEvents %></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stats-group">
      <div class="stats-group-title">Revisores</div>
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card reviewers">
          <div class="stat-label">Revisores Ativos</div>
          <div class="stat-value"><%= activeReviewers %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card inactive-reviewers">
          <div class="stat-label">Revisores Inativos</div>
          <div class="stat-value"><%= inactiveReviewers %></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stats-group">
      <div class="stats-group-title">Usuários</div>
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card total-users">
          <div class="stat-label">Total de Usuários</div>
          <div class="stat-value"><%= totalUsers %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card pending-users">
          <div class="stat-label">Usuários Pendentes</div>
          <div class="stat-value"><%= pendingUsers %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card articles">
          <div class="stat-label">Inscritos</div>
          <div class="stat-value"><%= totalRegisteredParticipants %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card future-registrations">
          <div class="stat-label">Inscritos em Eventos Futuros</div>
          <div class="stat-value"><%= futureRegistrations %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card articles">
          <div class="stat-label">Inscritos Autores</div>
          <div class="stat-value"><%= authorRegistrations %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card articles">
          <div class="stat-label">Inscritos Participantes</div>
          <div class="stat-value"><%= listenerRegistrations %></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stats-group">
      <div class="stats-group-title">Artigos</div>
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card articles">
          <div class="stat-label">Total de Artigos</div>
          <div class="stat-value"><%= totalArticles %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card pending-articles">
          <div class="stat-label">Pendências com Artigos</div>
          <div class="stat-value"><%= pendingArticles %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card pending-articles">
          <div class="stat-label">Sem Revisor</div>
          <div class="stat-value"><%= articlesWithoutReviewer %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card review-running">
          <div class="stat-label">Em Análise</div>
          <div class="stat-value"><%= articlesUnderReview %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card ready-decision">
          <div class="stat-label">Prontos para Deliberação</div>
          <div class="stat-value"><%= articlesReadyForDecision %></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Artigos sem revisor atribuído</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section-body">
        <% if (pendingReviewAssignmentArticles.length > 0) { %>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Título</th><th>Evento</th><th>Tipo</th><th>Status</th><th>Submetido em</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <% pendingReviewAssignmentArticles.forEach(a => { %>
            <tr>
              <td><a href="/admin/articles/<%= a.id %>?eventId=<%= a.event_id %>"><%= a.title %></a></td>
              <td><%= a.event_name %></td>
              <td><span class="badge badge-<%= a.type %>"><%= a.type === 'oral' ? 'Oral' : 'Poster' %></span></td>
              <td><span class="badge badge-<%= a.status %>"><%= a.status %></span></td>
              <td><%= new Date(a.created_at).toLocaleDateString('pt-BR') %></td>
            </tr>
            <% }) %>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <% } else { %>
        <div class="empty">
          <p>Todos os artigos submetidos já possuem revisor atribuído.</p>
          <p>Não há artigos aguardando designação de revisor.</p>
        </div>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Artigos ainda em análise pelos revisores</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section-body">
        <% if (inReviewArticles.length > 0) { %>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Título</th><th>Evento</th><th>Tipo</th><th>Status</th><th>Submetido em</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <% inReviewArticles.forEach(a => { %>
            <tr>
              <td><a href="/admin/articles/<%= a.id %>?eventId=<%= a.event_id %>"><%= a.title %></a></td>
              <td><%= a.event_name %></td>
              <td><span class="badge badge-<%= a.type %>"><%= a.type === 'oral' ? 'Oral' : 'Poster' %></span></td>
              <td><span class="badge badge-in-review">Em análise</span></td>
              <td><%= new Date(a.created_at).toLocaleDateString('pt-BR') %></td>
            </tr>
            <% }) %>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <% } else { %>
        <div class="empty">
          <p>Não há artigos aguardando parecer dos revisores neste momento.</p>
        </div>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Artigos prontos para deliberação final</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section-body">
        <% if (readyForDecisionArticles.length > 0) { %>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Título</th><th>Evento</th><th>Tipo</th><th>Status</th><th>Submetido em</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <% readyForDecisionArticles.forEach(a => { %>
            <tr>
              <td><a href="/admin/articles/<%= a.id %>?eventId=<%= a.event_id %>"><%= a.title %></a></td>
              <td><%= a.event_name %></td>
              <td><span class="badge badge-<%= a.type %>"><%= a.type === 'oral' ? 'Oral' : 'Poster' %></span></td>
              <td><span class="badge badge-approved">Aguardando decisão final</span></td>
              <td><%= new Date(a.created_at).toLocaleDateString('pt-BR') %></td>
            </tr>
            <% }) %>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <% } else { %>
        <div class="empty">
          <p>Não há artigos com todos os pareceres concluídos aguardando decisão final.</p>
        </div>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Solicitações de subsídio não analisadas</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section-body">
        <% if (pendingSubsidyRequests.length > 0) { %>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Participante</th><th>Evento</th><th>Tipo</th><th>Instituição</th><th>Solicitado em</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <% pendingSubsidyRequests.forEach(request => { %>
            <tr>
              <td>
                <a href="/admin/events/<%= request.event_id %>/subsidies"><%= request.name %></a><br>
                <small style="color:#64748b;"><%= request.email %></small>
              </td>
              <td><%= request.event_name %></td>
              <td><span class="badge badge-pending"><%= request.registration_type === 'author' ? 'Autor' : 'Participante' %></span></td>
              <td><%= request.institution || '-' %></td>
              <td><%= new Date(request.created_at).toLocaleDateString('pt-BR') %></td>
            </tr>
            <% }) %>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <% } else { %>
        <div class="empty">
          <p>Não há solicitações de subsídio pendentes de análise.</p>
          <p>Todos os pedidos registrados já foram apreciados.</p>
        </div>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Solicitações de cadastro não analisadas</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section-body">
        <% if (pendingRegistrationRequests.length > 0) { %>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Nome</th><th>E-mail</th><th>Dados</th><th>Solicitado em</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <% pendingRegistrationRequests.forEach(user => { %>
            <tr>
              <td>
                <a href="/admin/users#cadastros-pendentes"><%= user.name || user.email %></a>
              </td>
              <td><%= user.email %></td>
              <td>
                <%= user.institution || '-' %>
                <% if (user.country) { %><br><small style="color:#64748b;"><%= user.country %></small><% } %>
                <% if (user.cpf || user.passport) { %><br><small style="color:#64748b;"><%= user.cpf || user.passport %></small><% } %>
              </td>
              <td><%= new Date(user.created_at).toLocaleDateString('pt-BR') %></td>
            </tr>
            <% }) %>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <% } else { %>
        <div class="empty">
          <p>Não há solicitações de cadastro pendentes de análise.</p>
          <p>Todos os pedidos de acesso já foram avaliados.</p>
        </div>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <% if (userEmail === 'admin@admin.com') { %>
      <% if (query && query.message) { %>
      <div style="background:rgba(59,130,246,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(96,165,250,0.25);border-radius:12px;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin-top:1.5rem;color:#bfdbfe;"><%= query.message %></div>
      <% } %>
      <div class="section" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
        <div class="section-header"><h2>Envio global de e-mails</h2></div>
        <div class="section-body" style="padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <div>
            <p style="color:<%= systemEmailSettings.email_enabled ? '#86efac' : '#fca5a5' %>;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 .35rem;"><%= systemEmailSettings.email_enabled ? 'Ativado' : 'Desativado' %></p>
            <p style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:.875rem;margin:0;">Master switch do sistema. <%= pendingEmailCount %> mensagem(ns) pendente(s).</p>
          </div>
          <form method="POST" action="/admin/email-settings/toggle" nonce="<%= cspNonce %>" onsubmit="return <%= systemEmailSettings.email_enabled ? "confirm('Desativar todos os e-mails e cancelar as mensagens pendentes?')" : 'true' %>;">
            <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="dashboard">
            <input type="hidden" name="enabled" value="<%= systemEmailSettings.email_enabled ? '0' : '1' %>">
            <button type="submit" class="btn <%= systemEmailSettings.email_enabled ? 'btn-danger' : 'btn-success' %>"><%= systemEmailSettings.email_enabled ? 'Desativar todos os e-mails' : 'Ativar envio global' %></button>
          </form>
        </div>
        <% if (pendingEmailCount > 0) { %>
        <details>
          <summary class="email-queue-summary">Ver mensagens pendentes (<%= pendingEmailCount %>)</summary>
          <div class="table-scroll">
            <table>
              <thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Destinatário</th><th>Mensagem</th><th>Evento</th><th>Status</th><th>Agendamento</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                <% const emailTypeLabels = { account_requested: 'Solicitação de cadastro', account_approved: 'Cadastro aprovado', imported_account: 'Conta criada', imported_account_registration: 'Conta e inscrição', imported_registration: 'Inscrição no evento', event_reminder: 'Lembrete do evento', certificate_issued: 'Certificado emitido', certificate_reissued: 'Certificado reemitido', video_link_changed: 'Alteração de transmissão' }; %>
                <% pendingEmails.forEach(email => { %>
                <tr>
                  <td>#<%= email.id %></td>
                  <td><strong><%= email.recipient_name || '-' %></strong><br><small><%= email.recipient_email %></small></td>
                  <td><%= emailTypeLabels[email.message_type] || email.message_type %><br><small><%= email.subject %></small></td>
                  <td><% if (email.event_id) { %><a href="/admin/events/<%= email.event_id %>/edit"><%= email.event_name || ('Evento #' + email.event_id) %></a><% } else { %>Sistema<% } %></td>
                  <td><span class="badge email-status-<%= email.status %>"><%= email.status === 'failed' ? 'Falha / nova tentativa' : 'Na fila' %></span><br><small><%= email.attempts %> tentativa(s)</small><% if (email.last_error) { %><small class="email-error"><%= email.last_error %></small><% } %></td>
                  <td><small>Criada: <%= email.created_at || '-' %><br>Disponível: <%= email.available_at || '-' %><% if (email.next_attempt_at) { %><br>Próxima tentativa: <%= email.next_attempt_at %><% } %></small></td>
                </tr>
                <% }) %>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <% if (pendingEmailCount > pendingEmails.length) { %><p style="padding:1rem 1.5rem;color:#94a3b8;">Exibindo as primeiras <%= pendingEmails.length %> de <%= pendingEmailCount %> mensagens.</p><% } %>
        </details>
        <% } %>
      </div>
      <% if (query && query.reset === 'success') { %>
      <div style="background:rgba(52,211,153,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(52,211,153,0.3);border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem;margin-top:1.5rem;text-align:center;">
        <p style="color:#34d399;font-weight:600;">Banco de dados resetado com sucesso. O servidor será reiniciado automaticamente.</p>
      </div>
      <% } else if (query && query.reset === 'error') { %>
      <div style="background:rgba(239,68,68,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.3);border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem;margin-top:1.5rem;text-align:center;">
        <p style="color:#f87171;font-weight:600;">Erro ao resetar o banco de dados. Verifique os logs do servidor.</p>
      </div>
      <% } %>
      <% if (query && query.restore === 'success') { %>
      <div style="background:rgba(52,211,153,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(52,211,153,0.3);border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem;margin-top:1.5rem;text-align:center;">
        <p style="color:#34d399;font-weight:600;">Backup restaurado com sucesso. Banco de dados e arquivos substituídos.</p>
      </div>
      <% } else if (query && query.backup === 'error') { %>
      <div style="background:rgba(239,68,68,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.3);border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem;margin-top:1.5rem;text-align:center;">
        <p style="color:#f87171;font-weight:600;">Erro ao gerar o backup. Verifique os logs do servidor.</p>
      </div>
      <% } %>

      <div class="section" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Backup e Restauração</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="section-body" style="padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;">
          <p style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.875rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">O backup inclui o banco de dados completo (artigos.db) e a pasta de arquivos enviados (uploads). Use o backup para sincronizar o sistema entre as suas máquinas de desenvolvimento.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:0.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;">
            <a href="/admin/backup/download" class="btn btn-success" nonce="<%= cspNonce %>" onclick="return confirm('Baixar o backup completo (banco + arquivos) agora?')">Baixar Backup</a>
            <a href="/admin/backup/restore" class="btn btn-warn" nonce="<%= cspNonce %>" onclick="return confirm('ATENÇÃO: Restaurar um backup SUBSTITUIRÁ todos os dados e arquivos atuais. Deseja continuar?')">Restaurar Backup</a>
            <a href="/admin/db/reset" class="btn btn-danger" nonce="<%= cspNonce %>" onclick="return confirm('ATENÇÃO: Esta ação apagará TODOS os dados do sistema. Deseja continuar?')">Resetar Banco de Dados</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% } %>
  </main>

  <footer>&copy; <%= year %> LIGEM.Redes • <%= typeof appVersion !== 'undefined' ? appVersion : 'V0.1' %></footer>
<%- include("../partials/csrf-inject") %>
  </body>
</html>
